mlxflow 0.8; network
1. Read Text             urls.txt
2. Split                 by=lines
3. <each fetch_one; on_error=skip>   [text] -> [text]
     1. Web Fetch   (input:1)   as=markdown
4. Join Text
5. Split                 chunk_size=500
6. Embed                 BGE-M3
7. Store Index   (5,6)   webdocs.index
